Spawn an independent worker process. By default uses a built-in agent with {tools} tools. {history_note}{opencode_note}

If OpenCode is enabled and the task is coding-heavy (multi-file edits, debugging, refactors), set `worker_type` to `"opencode"` and include a `directory`.

When the work executes a board task, pass `task_number` — the task's execution plan (worker type, project, worktree, required skills) is loaded and enforced over the other arguments, the worker is bound to the task, and an approved task moves to in-progress. A task with worktree_mode "create" gets its own worktree provisioned automatically.

{sandbox_note}
